   "offered_by": {
    "allegiance": "codex/black_templars/allegiances/allegiance_black_templars"
   },
   "text": "Restrictions\n\n- Your army must include at least 1 The Emperor's Champion unit.\n- A Captain must be your Warlord.\n- Your army must include at least 2 Crusader squads.\n\nBenefits\n\n- Once per game, at the start of your Movement Phase, you can swap 1 Vow which you selected during Deployment to be active for a different Vow you did not select during Deployment.\n- You may field 1 Sword Brethren unit as a Troops Choices with the Support Squad special rule.\n- The Emperor's Champion does not take up a Force Organization Slot.",
